OL,12,     Gweek for Soweto Kinch, presents
OL,13,     G'Round Midnight - a weeknight
OL,14,     Gcelebration of jazz from across
OL,15,     Gthe spectrum, with a particular
OL,16,     Gfocus on new UK music.
